[I] Simple hibernation daemon

[T] beard, the Bear Hibernation Daemon, periodically checks the battery
[T] state in sysfs and runs pm-hibernate when the remaining energy falls to
[T] 3% of full capacity or below. A check can also be triggered by sending
[T] it a HUP signal.

[U] https://codeberg.org/ahills/beard/

[A] Beard Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

